  "baseCommit": "42f31b5cfdc4b0345edd1fe64b5722c8b834a9fd",
  "change": "State that a signed-in customer can submit the nonempty cart without another navigation step or extra required fields. Only the agent-visible checkout interface text changes. Remove one erased, unused local type member and two unused test stubs; production JavaScript is unchanged.",
