    "afterSha256": "3b374bbff2f136f59d9ba512449a11c1ef010669845b7d114af937470276f4d6",
    "added": "Opening a nonempty cart with `cart-toggle` makes `checkout-submit` available without another\nnavigation step. A signed-in customer can check out that cart without entering additional\nrequired fields. Any extra checkout fields are optional.\n"
